WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.767
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.467
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.267
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.133
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:05.434
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:08.400
After announcing
his 2024 reelection campaign,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.501
President Biden delivered
a speech yesterday

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:12.467
about his economic vision
for the country.

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.234
That's right, from now on,

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:17.100
the grandkids are getting $6

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.200
in their birthday cards.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.667
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.400
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.934
endorsed President Biden
yesterday

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.968
and said he will do what he can
to make sure Biden is reelected.

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.868
But if Biden loses,
the two of them

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.934
can always go back
to heckling the Muppets.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:32.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:33.734
Following recent reports

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:36.367
of Justice Clarence Thomas'
failure to disclose

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:40.100
lavish vacations and gifts
from a wealthy Republican donor,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.400
the Supreme Court released

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.133
a three-page
statement yesterday,

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:46.334
signed by all nine justices,
committing to follow,

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.767
"foundational ethics
and principles."

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.400
Starting now.
I mean, now.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
Okay, now! Damn it, Clarence!

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:54.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:56.501
That's right,
all nine Supreme Court justices

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:57.767
signed a pledge to follow

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.868
"foundational ethics
and principles."

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:03.267
Okay, but it wasn't all nine
of them we were worried about.

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.901
[ Laughter ]
I mean, Elena Kagan's
last vacation was

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.334
to the Lincoln Memorial.

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.767
Took the bus.

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:11.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:13.767
In honor
of Lesbian Visibility Week,

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:16.534
the cast of
"The L Word: Generation Q"

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:18.434
yesterday
visited the White House,

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.534
said Tucker Carlson
to a house plant.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:23.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:25.100
A top aide to Republican

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.634
presidential hopeful
Vivek Ramaswamy

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.234
said today
that he will be polling

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:32.400
in second or third place
by the end of the year.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.334
Unless, of course,
a fourth person joins the race.

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:37.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:39.667
The USDA announced yesterday

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.467
that it is considering
making changes

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.000
to limit the amount
of salmonella

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.634
in some chicken products.

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:46.734
I'm sorry,
they haven't already?

00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:48.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:50.300
"We're also considering
a three strikes rule,

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.868
if it's secretly a pigeon.

00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:56.000
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.868
[ Cheering ]
You can get away with it twice."

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:01.334
Ben and Jerry's cofounder
Ben Cohen

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:06.400
recently launched a new cannabis
line called Ben's Best Blnz.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:10.634
Hopefully it's a lot
more popular than...

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:13.567
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:18.734
That was easy to do

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.534
because we had a pack
lying around.

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.067
Quarterback Aaron Rodgers
reportedly spent a week

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.634
in Costa Rica
at a spiritual healing center

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:28.868
before officially signing
with the New York Jets,

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:32.100
which is like washing your car
right before it rains.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:37.434
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos was
photographed over the weekend

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:40.000
at Coachella
and even he couldn't believe

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.734
how much they were charging
for water.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.434 --> 00:02:45.767
And, finally, authorities
in Mexico recently seized

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:48.601
nearly 12,000 tequila bottles
that contained

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.200
concentrated liquid meth.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.534
On the bright side,
Margarita night ended

00:02:52.534 --> 00:02:55.300
with a completely
spotless house.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.968
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

